{"id":"n38103-1-10","stage":1,"title":"기온 · 气温","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38103-1-10-1","ko":"오늘 일기 예보를 들으니 낮 기온이 많이 오른대요.","zh":"今天听天气预报说，白天的气温会升得很高。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"일기","meaning":"天气","explanation":"일기：天气。","readings":[{"term":"일기","audio":"/audio/6786dd1c77aabb011253.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70779","senseId":"1","lemma":"일기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일기","audio":"/audio/6786dd1c77aabb011253.mp3"}},{"text":"예보를","meaning":"预报","explanation":"예보：预报；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"예보","audio":"/audio/e42802dfc8235a4016cf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14141","senseId":"1","lemma":"예보","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"예보를","audio":"/audio/4744f21936f9656c5ab0.mp3"}},{"text":"들으니","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"2","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들으니","audio":"/audio/ef71319629dc92fce6c7.mp3"}},{"text":"낮","meaning":"白天，白日，日间","explanation":"낮：白天，白日，日间。","readings":[{"term":"낮","audio":"/audio/cde379a91768ef6117a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64497","senseId":"1","lemma":"낮","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"낮","audio":"/audio/cde379a91768ef6117a6.mp3"}},{"text":"기온이","meaning":"气温","explanation":"기온：气温；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기온","audio":"/audio/48d003e07a2183c4aa32.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38103","senseId":"1","lemma":"기온","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"su